Shoals.Tenor.parse_tenor: unknown unit suffix (expected D/W/M/Y)

`parse_tenor` guards the unit suffix with a runtime `fail` naming the
function and the accepted set (src/tenor.ch `parse_unit_suffix`). The
tenor text is a runtime value, so the rejection is a runtime panic; the
`len < 2` and non-integer-count guards are the same shape.
